<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
<Document>
  <name>Zulia Central Forest Reserve — NFA Licence No. 30 concession</name>
  <description><![CDATA[
<b>Zulia Central Forest Reserve, Kaabong District, Uganda</b><br/>
Licensee: Zulia Conservancy (Uganda) Ltd — NFA Licence No. 30, 26 May 2022, 50-year term (24-month probation to 25 May 2024), 102,893 ha per certificate.<br/><br/>
<b>Boundary source:</b> World Database on Protected Areas, site 40604 "Zulia" (Forest Reserve, status year 1950), dataset "Forest Reserves of Uganda", National Forestry Authority via RCMRD, updated 2021. Polygon generalised to ~80 m; WDPA GIS area 925.5 km².<br/>
Kidepo Valley NP: WDPA site 958, GIS area 1,430.9 km².<br/><br/>
<b>Caveat:</b> the licence certificate states 102,893 ha (1,029 km²) and the 2019 technical proposal 916 km²; the NFA/WDPA GIS polygon measures ~925 km². Zulia was never fully demarcated on the ground (licence cl. 3.13 obliges NFA to re-survey within one year of commencement). Treat this outline as indicative pending NFA's cadastral survey.<br/>
Prepared 27 Oct 2026.
  ]]></description>
  <Style id="zulia"><LineStyle><color>ff00a000</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>4000c800</color></PolyStyle></Style>
  <Style id="kidepo"><LineStyle><color>ff00c8ff</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>2000c8ff</color></PolyStyle></Style>
